-<p class="example-end"></p></blockquote>
-<p class="Textbody">This chapter restricts attention to languages with a dedicated inflectional optative form as in (1), and disregards non-inflectional means for expressing the speaker's wish such as (2) and (3).</p>
-<h2 class="heading-1">
-<a name="2._Definition_of_values"></a>2. Definition of values</h2>
-<p class="Textbody">The two values shown on the map are given in the feature-value table: </p>
-<div style="text-align:left">
