-<p class="Standard">go.<span class="T3"><span class="hint--bottom" data-hint="imperative">imp</span>.<span class="hint--bottom" data-hint="singular">2sg</span></span></p>
-</td>
-</tr>
-<tr>
-<td style="text-align:left;"> 
-        </td>
